Description: satori desktop (metapackage)
 Depends on every component of the satori desktop: herbstluftwm on XLibre,
 with polybar, rofi, dunst, PipeWire, NetworkManager, gnome-keyring and
 satori's default applications. See docs/desktop-stack.md in the satori
 repository for why each one was chosen.
